  "problem": "Identify the sentence that is equivalent to the following: \"The apple is green or it is red.\"",
  "worked_solution": "First, let's write the sentence more concisely:\n\n\"The apple is green or red.\"\n\nUsing the commutative law, we can swap the order of the words \"green\" and \"red.\" The sentence now reads\n\n\"The apple is red or green.\"",
